
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070
@tripId = 5

### 1. Kontrollér at serveren kører
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.clear("token");

    if (response.status === 200 && response.body.token) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    }
%}


### 3. Se den bruger, der er logget ind
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Søg efter destinationer i Norge
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinations?search=Norge


### 5. Se mine gemte rejser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. Se rejseplan og budget
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. Se rejsens aktiviteter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. Se vejret i Oslo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weather/destinations/OSL


### 9. Adgang uden token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me


### 10. Ugyldigt rejse-ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. Forkert datatype ved login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": {
    "forkert": "datatype"
  },
  "password": "Test12345!"
}


### 12. Forkert datatype for pris
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/activities/custom
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testaktivitet",
  "date": "2026-11-22",
  "time": "12:00",
  "priceAmount": "hej",
  "category": "Test",
  "notes": ""
}


### 13. Null som request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

null


### 14. Gyldig destination
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "OSL"
}


### 15. Decimal i antal voksne
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "CPH",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-25",
  "adults": 1.5,
  "directOnly": false
}


### 16. Gyldige rejseoplysninger
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/trip-draft/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "CPH",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-25",
  "adults": 1,
  "directOnly": false
}


### 17. Søg efter flybilletter med Duffel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### US1.1 - Registrer ny bruger
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Bruger",
  "email": "us1ny20261029d@example.com",
  "password": "Test12345!"
}

### US1.2 - Registrer samme email igen
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Bruger",
  "email": "us1test20261028@example.com",
  "password": "Test12345!"
}

### US1.3 - For kort adgangskode
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Bruger",
  "email": "us1invalid@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### US1.4 - Login
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "us1test20261028@example.com",
  "password": "Test12345!"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200 && response.body.token) {
        client.global.set("us1token", response.body.token);
    }
%}

### US1.5 - Hent bruger med JWT
GET http://localhost:7070/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}

### US1.6 - Hent bruger uden JWT
GET http://localhost:7070/api/auth/me

### US1.7 - Forkert adgangskode
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "us1test20261028@example.com",
  "password": "Forkert123!"
}

### US1.8 - Logout
POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}

