### US3.1 - Hent destinationsinformation om Oslo
GET http://localhost:7070/api/destinations/OSL
Accept: application/json

### US3.2 - Hent destinationsinformation om København
GET http://localhost:7070/api/destinations/CPH
Accept: application/json

### US3.3 - Ukendt destination
GET http://localhost:7070/api/destinations/XYZ
Accept: application/json

### US3.4 - Destination med små bogstaver
GET http://localhost:7070/api/destinations/osl
Accept: application/json

### US3.5 - Inspiration uden JWT
GET http://localhost:7070/api/destinations/ARN
Accept: application/json

### US4.1 - Start rejsekladde
POST http://localhost:7070/api/trip-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{us1token}}
Content-Type: application/json

